# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Media that isn't referenced by index.html.
#
# The assets folder holds ~700MB of raw/source footage that the site never
# loads. Three of those files are over GitHub's hard 100MB per-file limit
# (REEL WITH MUSIC.mp4 129MB, Kaipunyam_Reel_Final.mp4 117MB, NS INVITE 65MB),
# so committing them would make the push fail outright.
#
# Strategy: ignore every video, then explicitly un-ignore the two the site
# actually plays. Keep those originals backed up outside the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
!assets/INTRO.mp4
!assets/video/garlic-mix-zepto.mp4

# Source archives / design deliverables — not web assets
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.psd
*.ai
*.prproj

# Superseded slider set (replaced by assets/slider_new, nothing references it)
assets/slider/

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
